<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act comes into operation on 22 June 2012 and shall apply throughout Malaysia. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
