<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the provisions of this Act, the breadth of the territorial sea of Malaysia shall for all purposes be 12 nautical miles."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The baselines from which the breadth of that territorial sea is to be measured shall for all purposes be those established in accordance with section 5 of the Baseline of Maritime Zones Act 2006."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of the Continental Shelf Act 1966 [Act 83], Petroleum Mining Act 1966 [Act 95], the National Land Code [Act 56/65] and any written law relating to land in force in Sabah and Sarawak, any reference to territorial sea therein shall in relation to any territory be construed as a reference to such part of the sea adjacent to the coast thereof not exceeding 3 nautical miles measured from the low-water line. Sovereignty in respect of the territorial sea"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The sovereignty in respect of the territorial sea, and in respect of its bed and subsoil, is vested in and exercisable by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong in right of Malaysia. Maps and charts of limits of territorial sea"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
