<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may, on the recommendation of the Prime Minister—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
