<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/13/eng@> .
